  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This multi-sectoral intervention aimed at contributing to the improvement of the living conditions of communities affected by conflict and displacement in the regions of diffa and tillabri. This includes facilitating access for these displaced people to shelter, essential household items and economic opportunities to restore their livelihoods destroyed or lost in crises. Thus, as part of this intervention, assistance is provided in the form of shelter, nfi and support for the development of igas for idp, repatriated and refugee populations according to the vulnerability criteria defined and agreed with the stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
